<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="A week-by-week course planner for Caribbean higher education: active learning, constructive alignment, and face-to-face teaching quality.">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>ActiveCourse Studio</title>
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#0E2A26; --leaf:#1C6B5B; --leaf-deep:#134A3F; --leaf-soft:#E5EFEA;
  --chalk:#F1F4EF; --paper:#FFFFFF; --line:#D9E2DC; --muted:#63756F;
  --ochre:#A96A12; --ochre-soft:#FBF1DF; --ochre-line:#E8D4AE;
  --rust:#A2402C; --rust-soft:#F7E4E0; --rust-line:#E9C6BE;
  --sea:#2C6E8F; --sea-soft:#E3EEF3;
  --display:Georgia,"Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",Palatino,serif;
  --body:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
  --util:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  --r:14px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--chalk);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
input,textarea,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ochre);outline-offset:2px}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5{font-weight:600}

/* ---------- top bar ---------- */
.topbar{background:var(--ink);color:#EAF2EE;padding:12px 20px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40}
.brand{font-family:var(--display);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.2px;white-space:nowrap}
.brand span{color:#8FC3B3}
.coursebox{flex:1;min-width:220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.coursebox input{background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:1px dashed #3E635B;color:#fff;padding:3px 0;font-family:var(--display);font-size:17px;width:100%}
.coursebox .sub{font-family:var(--util);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8FC3B3}
.picker{background:#17403A;color:#fff;border:1px solid #3E635B;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;max-width:230px;font-size:13.5px}
.tools{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{background:var(--leaf);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 13px;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px}
.btn:hover{background:var(--leaf-deep)}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid #3E635B;color:#DCEAE4}
.btn.ghost:hover{background:#173A34}
.btn.small{padding:6px 10px;font-size:12.5px;border-radius:8px}
.btn.quiet{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.btn.quiet:hover{background:var(--leaf-soft)}
.btn.warm{background:var(--ochre);color:#fff}
.btn.warm:hover{background:#8C570D}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}

/* ---------- shell ---------- */
.shell{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:272px 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}

/* ---------- week rail ---------- */
.rail{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px;position:sticky;top:70px}
.rail h2,.stage h2{font-family:var(--util);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}
.weeklist{display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-height:52vh;overflow:auto;margin:0 -6px;padding:0 6px}
.wk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:transparent;border:0;border-left:2px solid var(--line);text-align:left;padding:9px 8px;border-radius:0 9px 9px 0;color:var(--ink);width:100%}
.wk:hover{background:var(--chalk)}
.wk.on{background:var(--leaf-soft);border-left:2px solid var(--leaf)}
.wk .no{font-family:var(--util);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.wk.on .no{color:var(--leaf-deep);font-weight:700}
.wk .tp{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.3;overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical}
.wk .ring{grid-column:1;width:26px;height:26px}
.railfoot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.stat{font-family:var(--util);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.04em}
.railbtns{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* ---------- stage ---------- */
.stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;min-width:0}
.card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:18px}
.card.personal{background:var(--ochre-soft);border-color:var(--ochre-line)}
.card.quality{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#F7FAF8,#fff);border-color:var(--line)}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--util);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--leaf);font-weight:700}
.card.personal .eyebrow{color:var(--ochre)}
.hdrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px}
.hint{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:2px 0 14px;max-width:66ch}
.hint.tight{margin-bottom:6px}
h1.topic{font-family:var(--display);font-size:27px;line-height:1.2;margin:6px 0 0}
.topicinput{font-family:var(--display);font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;width:100%;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 0;background:transparent}
.topicinput:focus{border-bottom-color:var(--leaf)}

.field{margin:14px 0 0}
.field.tight{margin-top:9px}
.field label{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--util);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px}
input.t,textarea.t,select.t{width:100%;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper)}
textarea.t{min-height:84px;resize:vertical;line-height:1.55}
textarea.t.short{min-height:60px}
.card.personal input.t,.card.personal textarea.t{border-color:var(--ochre-line);background:#fffdf8}
input.t:focus,textarea.t:focus,select.t:focus{border-color:var(--leaf)}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}

.tag{font-family:var(--util);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.tag.src{background:var(--leaf-soft);color:var(--leaf-deep)}
.tag.edit{background:var(--ochre-soft);color:var(--ochre);border:1px solid var(--ochre-line)}
.tag.you{background:#EFEFEA;color:var(--muted)}
.tag.sea{background:var(--sea-soft);color:var(--sea)}
.tag.bad{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust)}
.linkbtn{background:none;border:0;color:var(--leaf);font-size:11.5px;text-decoration:underline;padding:0}
.linkbtn:hover{color:var(--leaf-deep)}

/* ---------- time ribbon ---------- */
.ribbon{display:flex;height:34px;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);margin:4px 0 6px}
.seg{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--util);font-size:10px;color:#fff;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap}
.legend{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--util);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}
.legend i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;display:inline-block;margin-right:5px}

.act{border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--leaf);border-radius:11px;padding:11px;margin:10px 0;background:var(--paper)}
.act .row1{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr 118px 128px auto;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.act .row2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
.act .mv{display:flex;gap:4px}
.iconbtn{background:var(--chalk);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:30px;height:30px;line-height:1;color:var(--muted)}
.iconbtn:hover{background:var(--leaf-soft);color:var(--leaf-deep)}
.iconbtn.del:hover{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);border-color:var(--rust-line)}
.mini{font-family:var(--util);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}
.techbox{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}

/* ---------- quality panel ---------- */
.qhead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:center}
.qscore{text-align:center;min-width:96px}
.bignum{font-family:var(--display);font-size:38px;line-height:1}
.qbars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;min-width:0}
.qbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:112px 1fr 64px;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:12.5px}
.meter{height:9px;background:var(--line);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px}
.checks{margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.check{display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:9px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);align-items:start}
.check:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.check .ic{font-weight:700;line-height:1.35}
.check.ok .ic{color:var(--leaf)}
.check.warn .ic{color:var(--ochre)}
.check.bad .ic{color:var(--rust)}
.check .ttl{font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px}
.check .dt{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.check.ok{opacity:.72}
.blooms{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:4px}
.bl{font-family:var(--util);font-size:9.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--sea-soft);color:var(--sea);font-weight:700}
.bl.none{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust)}

/* ---------- chips / library ---------- */
.chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:4px 0 10px}
.chip{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}
.chip:hover{background:var(--leaf-soft)}
.chip.on{background:var(--leaf);color:#fff;border-color:var(--leaf)}
.movegrid{max-height:44vh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--chalk)}
.move{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:10px 12px;margin:9px 0;background:var(--paper)}
.move .mh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}
.move h5{margin:0;font-size:14.5px}
.move .md{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:5px 0 0}
.move .mt{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:7px;align-items:center}

/* ---------- dashboard ---------- */
.dashgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:12px}
.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;background:var(--paper)}
.panel h5{margin:0 0 3px;font-size:13.5px}
.panel .sublabel{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 9px}
.bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;height:96px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:1px}
.bars{justify-content:flex-start}
.bars .col{flex:1;max-width:48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-width:4px;gap:1px}
.bars .b{border-radius:2px 2px 0 0;min-height:1px}
.xlabels{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:4px}
.xlabels span{max-width:48px}
.xlabels span{flex:1;text-align:center;font-family:var(--util);font-size:8.5px;color:var(--muted);overflow:hidden}
.hbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:78px 1fr 34px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;margin:5px 0}
.hbar .track{height:12px;background:var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.hbar .track i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--sea);border-radius:4px}
.hbar .n{font-family:var(--util);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}

/* ---------- modal ---------- */
.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#0E2A26CC;display:none;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:28px 16px;z-index:60;overflow:auto}
.scrim.open{display:flex}
.modal{background:var(--paper);border-radius:18px;max-width:780px;width:100%;padding:22px}
.modal.wide{max-width:1020px}
.modal h3{font-family:var(--display);font-size:23px;margin:2px 0 4px}
.drop{border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:26px;text-align:center;background:var(--chalk);margin:14px 0 10px}
.drop.hot{border-color:var(--leaf);background:var(--leaf-soft)}
.preview{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;max-height:230px;overflow:auto;margin-top:12px}
.prow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 130px;gap:8px;padding:8px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px;align-items:center}
.prow:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.prow .n{font-family:var(--util);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.prow .meta{font-family:var(--util);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}
.modalfoot{display:flex;gap:9px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.status{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);min-height:20px;margin-top:8px}
.status.bad{color:var(--rust)}
.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:9px;display:none}
.bar.on{display:block}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--leaf);width:0;transition:width .25s}
.choice{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;margin:9px 0}
.note{background:var(--sea-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--sea);padding:9px 12px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:#274F63;margin:10px 0}

.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:11px;font-size:13.5px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.25s;z-index:80;max-width:88vw;text-align:center}
.toast.on{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.saved{font-family:var(--util);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8FC3B3;white-space:nowrap}
.sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}

@media(max-width:980px){
  .shell{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:14px}
  .rail{position:static}
  .weeklist{max-height:none;flex-direction:row;overflow-x:auto}
  .wk{min-width:190px;border-left:0;border-top:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:0 0 9px 9px}
  .wk.on{border-left:0;border-top:2px solid var(--leaf)}
  .grid2,.grid3,.grid4{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .act .row1{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .act .row2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .qhead{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .qbar{grid-template-columns:96px 1fr 54px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
@media print{
  .topbar,.rail,.noprint,.scrim{display:none!important}
  body{background:#fff}
  .shell{display:block;max-width:none;padding:0}
  .card{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:0;padding:12px 0;break-inside:avoid}
  textarea.t,input.t{border:0;padding:0;resize:none;height:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar noprint">
<div class="brand">ActiveCourse <span>Studio</span></div>
<div class="coursebox">
<input id="courseTitle" placeholder="Course title" aria-label="Course title">
<div class="sub"><span id="courseMeta">Add a course code, term and institution in Settings</span></div>
</div>
<select class="picker" id="coursePicker" aria-label="Switch course"></select>
<div class="saved" id="savedFlag">Saved</div>
<div class="tools">
<button class="btn ghost" id="btnCourses">Courses</button>
<button class="btn" id="btnImport">Import outline</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="btnDash">Course view</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="btnCoach">Ask the coach</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="btnExport">Export</button>
<button class="btn ghost" id="btnSettings">Settings</button>
</div>
</header>

<div class="shell">
<aside class="rail noprint">
<h2>Course weeks</h2>
<div class="weeklist" id="weekList"></div>
<div class="railfoot">
<button class="btn quiet small" id="btnAddWeek">+ Add a week</button>
<div class="stat" id="railStat">&mdash;</div>
<div class="stat" id="railQuality">&mdash;</div>
<div class="railbtns">
<button class="linkbtn" id="btnPrintWeek">Print this week</button>
<button class="linkbtn" id="btnPrintAll">Print whole course</button>
</div>
</div>
</aside>

<main class="stage">
<section class="card">
<div class="hdrow">
<div class="eyebrow" id="weekEyebrow">Week 01</div>
<div class="noprint" style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
<span id="frameBadges" style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center"></span>
<button class="btn warm small" id="btnPlanWeek">Draft this week with AI</button>
<button class="btn quiet small" id="btnWeekDownload">Download this week</button>
</div>
</div>
<input class="topicinput" id="topic" placeholder="What is this week about?" aria-label="Week topic">
<div class="field">
<label for="question">Essential question <span class="tag you">drives the session</span></label>
<input class="t" id="question" placeholder="The one question students should be able to argue by the end of the session">
</div>
<div class="grid2">
<div class="field">
<label for="objectives">Learning objectives <span id="badgeObj"></span></label>
<textarea class="t" id="objectives" placeholder="One per line. Start each with an action verb: analyse, apply, evaluate, design&hellip;"></textarea>
<div class="blooms" id="bloomStrip"></div>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="readings">Readings and resources <span id="badgeRead"></span></label>
<textarea class="t" id="readings" placeholder="One per line"></textarea>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid2">
<div class="field">
<label for="assessment">Assessment due or in progress <span id="badgeAss"></span></label>
<textarea class="t" id="assessment" placeholder="One per line"></textarea>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="concepts">Threshold concepts students trip on</label>
<textarea class="t" id="concepts" placeholder="What usually goes wrong here, and the check you will run for it"></textarea>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="card quality noprint">
<div class="hdrow">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Teaching quality check</div>
<div class="hint tight">Runs on your own machine, instantly, with no AI and no internet. It reads this week against constructive alignment and active-learning evidence, and tells you the specific thing to change.</div>
</div>
<button class="btn quiet small" id="btnQualityHelp">What is checked?</button>
</div>
<div class="qhead">
<div class="qscore">
<div class="bignum" id="qScore">&mdash;</div>
<div class="mini" id="qVerdict">not planned</div>
</div>
<div class="qbars" id="qBars"></div>
</div>
<div class="checks" id="qChecks"></div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<div class="hdrow">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">The class itself</div>
<div class="hint tight">Minutes are drawn to scale. If the pale band is wider than the rest, students are listening more than working.</div>
</div>
<div class="stat" id="minuteCount">0 min</div>
</div>
<div class="ribbon" id="ribbon"></div>
<div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
<div id="activities"></div>
<div class="railbtns noprint" style="margin-top:4px">
<button class="btn quiet small" id="btnAddAct">+ Add a move</button>
<button class="btn quiet small" id="btnLibrary">Insert from the move library</button>
<button class="btn quiet small" id="btnBalance">Rebalance to the class length</button>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="exit">Exit ticket <span class="tag sea">evidence you leave with</span></label>
<textarea class="t short" id="exit" placeholder="The evidence you leave the room with"></textarea>
</div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<div class="eyebrow">Room, group and fallback</div>
<div class="hint">Face-to-face teaching lives or dies on these details. They also feed the AI drafts, so a plan written for eighty students in fixed tiered seating does not come back assuming twenty around a table.</div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="field">
<label for="wSeats">Students expected this week</label>
<input class="t" id="wSeats" type="number" min="0" max="2000" placeholder="Leave blank to use the course default">
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="wRoom">Room for this session</label>
<select class="t" id="wRoom">
<option value="">Use the course default</option>
<option value="flat">Flat room, movable chairs</option>
<option value="tiered">Tiered lecture theatre, fixed seats</option>
<option value="seminar">Seminar room, one table</option>
<option value="lab">Laboratory or studio</option>
<option value="field">Off campus or field site</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="wGroups">How groups are formed</label>
<input class="t" id="wGroups" placeholder="Fours by row, counted off, kept from last week&hellip;">
</div>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="wFallback">If the power, projector or internet fails</label>
<textarea class="t short" id="wFallback" placeholder="The version of this class you can teach with a board and paper only"></textarea>
</div>
</section>

<section class="card personal">
<div class="eyebrow">Your layer</div>
<div class="hint">Nothing here comes from the outline and nothing here gets overwritten when you re-import or redraft. This is where the course becomes yours, and where the Caribbean gets into it.</div>
<div class="grid2">
<div class="field">
<label for="pHook">Opening hook, story, or provocation</label>
<textarea class="t" id="pHook" placeholder="The clip, the headline, the argument you walk in with"></textarea>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="pLocal">Local and lived examples <span class="tag sea">regional</span></label>
<textarea class="t" id="pLocal" placeholder="Cases, data, policy and voices your students already recognise"></textarea>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid2">
<div class="field">
